{"suttaId":"tha-ap487","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2071,2165],"vripara":"75"},"segments":{"tha-ap487:0.3":"Candanamāliyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap487:1.1":"“Pañca kāmaguṇe hitvā, piyarūpe manorame;","tha-ap487:1.3":"Asītikoṭiyo hitvā, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","tha-ap487:2.1":"“Pabbajitvāna kāyena, pāpakammaṃ vivajjayiṃ;","tha-ap487:2.3":"Vacīduccaritaṃ hitvā, nadīkūle vasāmahaṃ.","tha-ap487:3.1":"“Ekakaṃ maṃ viharantaṃ, buddhaseṭṭho upāgami;","tha-ap487:3.3":"Nāhaṃ jānāmi buddhoti, akāsiṃ paṭisantharaṃ [paṭisandhāraṃ (ka.)].","tha-ap487:4.1":"“Karitvā paṭisanthāraṃ, nāmagottamapucchahaṃ;","tha-ap487:4.3":"‘Devatānusi gandhabbo, adu sakko purindado.","tha-ap487:5.1":"“‘Ko vā tvaṃ kassa vā putto, mahābrahmā idhāgato;","tha-ap487:5.3":"Virocesi disā sabbā, udayaṃ sūriyo yathā.","tha-ap487:6.1":"“‘Sahassārāni cakkāni, pāde dissanti mārisa;","tha-ap487:6.3":"Ko vā tvaṃ kassa vā putto, kathaṃ jānemu taṃ mayaṃ;","tha-ap487:6.5":"Nāmagottaṃ pavedehi, saṃsayaṃ apanehi me’.","tha-ap487:7.1":"“‘Namhi devo na gandhabbo, namhi [nāpi (sī.)] sakko purindado;","tha-ap487:7.3":"Brahmabhāvo ca me natthi, etesaṃ uttamo ahaṃ.","tha-ap487:8.1":"“‘Atīto visayaṃ tesaṃ, dālayiṃ kāmabandhanaṃ;","tha-ap487:8.3":"Sabbe kilese jhāpetvā, patto sambodhimuttamaṃ’.","tha-ap487:9.1":"“Tassa vācaṃ suṇitvāhaṃ, idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ;","tha-ap487:9.3":"‘Yadi buddhoti sabbaññū, nisīda tvaṃ mahāmune.","tha-ap487:10.1":"‘Tamahaṃ pūjayissāmi, dukkhassantakaro tuvaṃ’;","tha-ap487:10.3":"“Pattharitvā jinacammaṃ, adāsi satthuno ahaṃ.","tha-ap487:11.1":"“Nisīdi tattha bhagavā, sīhova girigabbhare;","tha-ap487:11.3":"Khippaṃ pabbatamāruyha, ambassa phalamaggahiṃ.","tha-ap487:12.1":"“Sālakalyāṇikaṃ pupphaṃ, candanañca mahārahaṃ;","tha-ap487:12.3":"Khippaṃ paggayha taṃ sabbaṃ, upetvā lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap487:13.1":"“Phalaṃ buddhassa datvāna, sālapupphamapūjayiṃ;","tha-ap487:13.3":"Candanaṃ anulimpitvā, avandiṃ satthuno ahaṃ.","tha-ap487:14.1":"“Pasannacitto sumano, vipulāya ca pītiyā;","tha-ap487:14.3":"Ajinamhi nisīditvā, sumedho lokanāyako.","tha-ap487:15.1":"“Mama kammaṃ pakittesi, hāsayanto mamaṃ tadā;","tha-ap487:15.3":"‘Iminā phaladānena, gandhamālehi cūbhayaṃ.","tha-ap487:16.1":"“‘Pañcavīse kappasate, devaloke ramissati;","tha-ap487:16.3":"Anūnamanasaṅkappo, vasavattī bhavissati.","tha-ap487:17.1":"“‘Chabbīsatikappasate, manussattaṃ gamissati;","tha-ap487:17.3":"Bhavissati cakkavattī, cāturanto mahiddhiko.","tha-ap487:18.1":"“‘Vebhāraṃ nāma nagaraṃ, vissakammena māpitaṃ;","tha-ap487:18.3":"Hessati sabbasovaṇṇaṃ, nānāratanabhūsitaṃ.","tha-ap487:19.1":"“‘Eteneva upāyena, saṃsarissati so bhave [yoniso (syā. pī.)];","tha-ap487:19.3":"Sabbattha pūjito hutvā, devatte atha mānuse.","tha-ap487:20.1":"“‘Pacchime bhave sampatte, brahmabandhu bhavissati;","tha-ap487:20.3":"Agārā abhinikkhamma, anagārī bhavissati;","tha-ap487:20.5":"Abhiññāpāragū hutvā, nibbāyissatināsavo’.","tha-ap487:21.1":"“Idaṃ vatvāna sambuddho, sumedho lokanāyako;","tha-ap487:21.3":"Mama nijjhāyamānassa, pakkāmi anilañjase.","tha-ap487:22.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap487:22.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap487:23.1":"“Tusitato cavitvāna, nibbattiṃ mātukucchiyaṃ;","tha-ap487:23.3":"Bhoge me ūnatā natthi, yamhi gabbhe vasāmahaṃ.","tha-ap487:24.1":"“Mātukucchigate mayi, annapānañca bhojanaṃ;","tha-ap487:24.3":"Mātuyā mama chandena, nibbattati yadicchakaṃ.","tha-ap487:25.1":"“Jātiyā pañcavassena, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","tha-ap487:25.3":"Oropitamhi kesamhi, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","tha-ap487:26.1":"“Pubbakammaṃ gavesanto, orena nāddasaṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap487:26.3":"Tiṃsakappasahassamhi, mama kammamanussariṃ.","tha-ap487:27.1":"“Namo te purisājañña, namo te purisuttama;","tha-ap487:27.3":"Tava sāsanamāgamma, pattomhi acalaṃ padaṃ.","tha-ap487:28.1":"“Tiṃsakappasahassamhi, yaṃ buddhamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap487:28.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap487:29.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap487:30.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap487:31.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap487:32.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā candanamāliyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap487:33.1":"Candanamāliyattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
